f","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124049.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123950\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nCreated a `ReimportState` structure that store the old `scenes_modification_table`, `scenes_reimported` and `resources_reimported`.\r\nThis structure is used to fill a reimport stack `reimport_state_stack` that get pushed in `_resources_reimporting` and poped in `_resources_reimported`.\r\n\r\n## Points to confirm\r\n\r\n- I'm doing unsafe access on `reimport_state_stack`. Calling `_resources_reimported` whithout calling `_resources_reimporting` first would result in a crash. I don't think it should ever be the case but if I missed something, we should add some guard.\r\n- I'm getting the values by dereferencing `reimport_state_stack.back()` on every calls, maybe I should use a temporary reference instead in relevant places ?\r\n- I changed List to `LocalVector` and `HashMap` to `AHashMap` in `ReimportState`. If there is any contraindication I could revert this.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124049/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}